<title>USA: THQ, Universal in game pact.</title>
<headline>THQ, Universal in game pact.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>TH*Q Inc said it signed an agreement with Seagram Co Ltd's Universal Studios Consumer Products Group to develop, publish and distribute the adventure-filled action game, &quot;The Lost World: Jurassic Park,&quot; based on the much-anticipated summer sequel to the blockbuster movie &quot;Jurassic Park.&quot;</p>
<p>The game will be distributed worldwide in October of 1997 for the Nintendo Game Boy platform.</p>
<p>The game, &quot;The Lost World:  Jurassic Park,&quot; is being developed for THQ by software developer Torus of Australia.</p>
</text>
